                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4757.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Ambassador
                        Riddle.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Is Russian Red Cross carrying on relief measures for famine sufferers of
                    Russia?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
